      <p class="req-note">* required</p>
      <!-- honeypot: bots fill it, humans never see it. Deliberately NOT named
           "company"/"website"/etc — those are common autofill dictionary
           entries, and a password manager or browser autofill silently
           filling a hidden field by name (ignoring autocomplete="off" and
           CSS visibility) would falsely trigger the honeypot for a real
           visitor. An unrecognized name avoids that. -->
      <input type="text" name="hp_topic" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true"
             style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0;" />
      <!-- Cloudflare Turnstile — verified server-side in functions/api/contact.js
           against TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY. size="flexible" spans the full field width
           instead of Cloudflare's fixed ~300px box; the CSS filter on #turnstile-widget
           above mutes its default chrome to sit closer to the page's palette (can't
           reach into the iframe itself, but a filter composites over it fine).
           data-action binds the resulting token to this specific form — the server
           checks result.action matches, so a token can't be solved somewhere else on
           the domain and replayed here (or vice versa, if another action is ever added). -->
      <div id="turnstile-widget" class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAEPWqejRev3MMXij"
           data-action="contact" data-theme="light" data-size="flexible"></div>
      <div class="cta-row">
